@page "/contribute"

<PageTitle>Contribute — IntentBlazor</PageTitle>
<p class="eyebrow">OPEN SOURCE</p>
<h1>Help shape<br />the framework.</h1>
<p class="lead">Bring a small improvement, a representative app scenario, or a focused design proposal.
    Ordinary contributor builds need no model account or API key.</p>
<h2>Run the foundation locally</h2>
<pre><code>git clone https://github.com/Kita72/IntentBlazor.git
cd IntentBlazor
pwsh -File scripts/Verify.ps1
dotnet run --project apps/IntentBlazor.Docs --no-launch-profile -- --environment Development --urls http://localhost:5180</code></pre>
<p>Install the SDK specified in global.json and PowerShell 7. Open localhost:5180 after starting the docs application.</p>
<section class="card-grid">
    <article class="card"><h2>Start small</h2><p>Improve documentation, clarify an error case,
        or describe a representative output document.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Discuss contracts</h2><p>Propose schema and public API changes before implementation.
        Keep domain features in extensions and application services.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><h2>Verify behaviour</h2><p>Use synthetic data and meaningful checks.
        Record actual outcomes separately from planned capabilities.</p></article>
</section>
